  "@type": ["dcat:Dataset", "rkaf:ReferenceCorpus"],
  "@id": "urn:rkaf:corpus:model-cards:v0.2",
  "dcterms:title":       "Rulespec Reference Corpus — AI Model Cards v0.2",
  "dcterms:description": "Canonical model-card fixtures demonstrating how Rulespec primitives compose to describe AI model identity, intended use, evaluation results, and governance posture. Each model card is a @graph bundle exercising AILineage → Assertion → Warrant → ConfidenceRecord → Attestation → ApplicabilityScope as a coherent governance artifact.",
